Recommends: libpipewire-0.3-modules-extra, libspa-0.2-modules-extra
Description: Model-specific host-side audio DSP for Apple T2 Macs
 Speaker and microphone graphs with automatic runtime profile selection.
 Requires a compatible T2 audio driver and AppleT2x2/x4/x6 UCM profiles.
 No BridgeXPC or T2 service dependency.
